From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Timothy Schmidt <timschmidt@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 20:28:40 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] media: qcom: camss: preserve MSM8226 RDI capture across
 system sleep

Pause the single raw capture pipeline in prepare and restart it in complete, after the system resume callbacks. Halt the Gen1 VFE bus and synchronize its IRQ before detaching buffers. Keep the media pipeline and videobuf2 queue allocated while the hardware is reset and powered down.

Retain active and pending buffers and the next sequence number outside the reset VFE. Restore the power reference and restart the same route on resume. Surface a queue error when halt or restart fails. Keep suspend guarded for multiple active routes, PIX output and shared VFE power.
---
